<div class="row home-content">
    <article class="homepage_content">
    <div>
      <h1 class="homepage_title">Search EThOS (E-Theses Online Service)</h1>
      <p class="homepage_intro">Search the metadata of over 650,000 UK doctoral theses.</p>

      <form class="search-form" id="search-form-header" role="search" onsubmit="$(&#39;.magnifying_glass&#39;).hide(); $(&#39;.loading_dots&#39;).show();" action="/catalog?locale=en" accept-charset="UTF-8" method="get"><input name="utf8" type="hidden" value="&#x2713;" autocomplete="off" />
  
  <input type="hidden" name="search_field" id="search_field" value="all_fields" autocomplete="off" />

  <div class="search-bar-container">
    <div class="flex-row flex-1">
      <div class="search-bar-wrapper search-bar-wrapper-no-mobile-width">
        <div data-qa="search_box_container" class="search_box_container">
          <!--<h2 class="visually-hidden"> Search bar </h2>-->
          <input autocomplete="off" name="q" type="text" id="main-search-bar" class="mat-mdc-input-element mat-mdc-autocomplete-trigger search-input-field cdk-text-field-autofill-monitored" aria-label="Search field" placeholder="Search EThOS" aria-invalid="false" aria-required="false" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="listbox">
            <div class="search-bar-actions inline-block">
              <button type="submit" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger search-btn mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-unthemed mat-mdc-button-base" aria-label="Submit search" title="Search">
                <svg class="magnifying_glass" onclick="$(this).hide(); $('.loading_dots').show();" height="100%" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="100%" fill="#666666" fit="" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" focusable="false"><path d="M380-320q-109 0-184.5-75.5T120-580q0-109 75.5-184.5T380-840q109 0 184.5 75.5T640-580q0 44-14 83t-38 69l224 224q11 11 11 28t-11 28q-11 11-28 11t-28-11L532-372q-30 24-69 38t-83 14Zm0-80q75 0 127.5-52.5T560-580q0-75-52.5-127.5T380-760q-75 0-127.5 52.5T200-580q0 75 52.5 127.5T380-400Z"></path></svg>
                <svg class="loading_dots" style="display: none;" fill="hsl(33 0% 40%)" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="4" cy="12" r="3" opacity="1"><animate id="spinner_qYjJ" begin="0;spinner_t4KZ.end-0.25s" attributeName="opacity" dur="0.75s" values="1;.2" fill="freeze"/></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" opacity=".4"><animate begin="spinner_qYjJ.begin+0.15s" attributeName="opacity" dur="0.75s" values="1;.2" fill="freeze"/></circle><circle cx="20" cy="12" r="3" opacity=".3"><animate id="spinner_t4KZ" begin="spinner_qYjJ.begin+0.3s" attributeName="opacity" dur="0.75s" values="1;.2" fill="freeze"/></circle></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-row ng-star-inserted" style="gap: 0.75rem;">
          <a href="/advanced">
          <button class="ethos-button basic-button mdc-button mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed mat-mdc-button-base">
            <span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span>
            <span class="mdc-button__label">Advanced search </span>
          </button>
</a>  
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</form>

      <div class="flex-row flex-layout-space-between width-100 welcome-announcements-container">
        <div class="announcements display-flex flex-column">
          <header class="flex-column gap-1">
            <h2 role="heading" aria-level="2" class="announcements-item-title mat-headline-medium">Introducing EThOS</h2>
          </header>
          <article>
            <p class="homepage_intro">We are pleased to share that EThOS (E-Theses Online Service) is now available again following restoration work.</p>
            <p class="homepage_intro">EThOS is an open access discovery platform for UK doctoral theses, managed by the British Library. The platform holds metadata for theses held in UK university repositories.</p>
            <p class="homepage_intro">In the platform you can find descriptions of over 650,000 theses from UK universities from the 1700s onwards. In many of the records in EThOS you will find a button ‘<b>Access thesis from university</b>’. This links to the metadata record of the thesis in the university repository, where it may be possible to download the thesis, if the university has made it available.
            <br/><br/>
            Please note:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>we are continuing to update the platform but there will be an initial backlog of content to work through</li>
              <li>not all theses are available from a university repository.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="homepage_intro">
              For further details, please refer to our <a href="/help?locale=en">FAQs</a> and <a href="/about?locale=en">About</a> sections.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>


</div>


